<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">leather backpack</ansi> (tailoring recipe)

A rugged <ansi fg="itemname">leather backpack</ansi> that reduces the effective
weight of items you carry. Worn in the <ansi fg="yellow">Back</ansi> slot -- you
give up cloak stats for practical carrying relief.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Stats ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Weight Reduction:</ansi>  35% of backpack contents
  <ansi fg="yellow">Slot:</ansi>              Back

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       tailoring (minimum 12)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     loom
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> leather strip (x3), thread spool (x2),
               bone needle

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help tailoring</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help inventory</ansi>
